SUMMARY:ODIUM HUMANI GENERIS | LOATHFINDER | ORBSTRUCT
DESCRIPTION:ODIUM HUMANI GENERIS (Black Metal\, Łódź)www.facebook.com/odiumbm www.instagram.com/odiumhumanigeneris_www.ohgofficial.bandcamp.com„Idée Fixe”https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hw1JKL3CdTY„Zaćmienie”https://youtu.be/ZO9fwqtyv64?si=zR6pmC3yYKqUjZUbPosłuchaj na Spotify:https://open.spotify.com/artist/2AddxutXZuIOQeP8zHtUdM\n LOATHFINDER (Black/Doom Metal\, Kraków)www.facebook.com/Loathfinder www.loathfinder.bandcamp.com The Great Tired Oneshttps://youtu.be/y1u5tXi-GRU?si=A32pZBllqDnUpsA1 Soil Of The Starvinghttps://youtu.be/1xM69FFkiAg?si=pRQGXX13OBVgU_yx Posłuchaj na Spotify:https://open.spotify.com/artist/36iqNhP5nn1rlJIXEaTZCw…\n ORBSTRUCT (Extreme/Death Metal\, Ukraina)A Decade of Transcendence:10th Anniversary Show! https://www.facebook.com/orbstructofficialhttps://www.instagram.com/orbstruct_official/ „Reaper’s Pathhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5Bf2tOnddc Posłuchaj na Spotify:https://open.spotify.com/artist/4csuw414qlYK7eA7E3CdEI…\n Miejsce: Łódź – Browar Warkot Data: 08.10.2026 Godzina: 18:00 Bilety: Dostępne na bramce w dniu koncertu
